# .opad documents are line-oriented, append-only text. LF keeps body-store hashes stable on every OS;
# The record-aware driver handles multiline sketch/drawing records; see docs/format.md.
# Without the local driver configuration Git falls back to ordinary text merging.
*.opad text eol=lf merge=opad
*.step text
*.stp  text
# The solver pack recipes run in bash and patch upstream sources: LF on every checkout (a Windows runner's autocrlf
# would make the scripts fail and the patches miss).
engines/** text eol=lf
